{"3704270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Magnavale: Eternal Soul", "steam_appid": 3704270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Castle Lexington beckons you. Step inside and learn the truth of your power. Fight hordes of demons, explore every passage, and discover new supplies for your loadout. Don't fear death, but embrace it. For the reaper itself is on your side, and it will revive you at your last resting place. Progress won't be lost, but some may remember your follies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704270/extras/7bce814e60bed25a23848fabcded319a.poster.avif?t=1778077979\" width=1170 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704270/extras/7bce814e60bed25a23848fabcded319a.webm?t=1778077979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704270/extras/7bce814e60bed25a23848fabcded319a.mp4?t=1778077979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dual Wield</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't settle for either a quick short-range sword, or a slow long-range axe. Take both instead, and attack with a light &amp; heavy weight weapon without the need for changing equipment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reap their Souls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death grants you the ability to steal the souls of your enemies. Within each soul lies a unique power. Powers such as conjuring projectiles, transforming your physical state, summoning a guardian for protection, altering your abilities, and more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Scavenge for Supplies</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique weapons, armor, food, and more are scattered across Castle Lexington. Some can be found within the clutches of enemies you've slain. Find new items and grow in strength. You may even find some that are rather remarkable, and perhaps extraordinary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704270/extras/9791d511cff9ce13eb84b3072ab26ffd.poster.avif?t=1778077979\" width=1170 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704270/extras/9791d511cff9ce13eb84b3072ab26ffd.webm?t=1778077979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704270/extras/9791d511cff9ce13eb84b3072ab26ffd.mp4?t=1778077979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Die at your Will</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is not merely an outcome, but a strategy. Use it to quickly return to your last save point, and retain all progress that you've accrued. Remain prudent in its use, as nothing in this world comes free.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 enemies, each with a unique soul ability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable HUD with attachable items for additional info.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A personal library filled with technical info, character details, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of areas within Castle Lexington to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time display of weapons &amp; souls in your inventory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional side quests with rewards for completion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller &amp; keyboard support with customizable controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable framerate from 60 to 240 FPS.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel-Perfect scaling with optional HD scaling.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704270/extras/99ed98be3a676baab592a9f217b7252d.poster.avif?t=1778077979\" width=1170 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704270/extras/99ed98be3a676baab592a9f217b7252d.webm?t=1778077979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704270/extras/99ed98be3a676baab592a9f217b7252d.mp4?t=1778077979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Castle Lexington beckons you. Step inside and learn the truth of your power. Fight hordes of demons, explore every passage, and discover new supplies for your loadout. Don't fear death, but embrace it. For the reaper itself is on your side, and it will revive you at your last resting place. Progress won't be lost, but some may remember your follies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704270/extras/7bce814e60bed25a23848fabcded319a.poster.avif?t=1778077979\" width=1170 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704270/extras/7bce814e60bed25a23848fabcded319a.webm?t=1778077979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704270/extras/7bce814e60bed25a23848fabcded319a.mp4?t=1778077979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dual Wield</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't settle for either a quick short-range sword, or a slow long-range axe. Take both instead, and attack with a light &amp; heavy weight weapon without the need for changing equipment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reap their Souls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death grants you the ability to steal the souls of your enemies. Within each soul lies a unique power. Powers such as conjuring projectiles, transforming your physical state, summoning a guardian for protection, altering your abilities, and more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Scavenge for Supplies</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique weapons, armor, food, and more are scattered across Castle Lexington. Some can be found within the clutches of enemies you've slain. Find new items and grow in strength. You may even find some that are rather remarkable, and perhaps extraordinary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704270/extras/9791d511cff9ce13eb84b3072ab26ffd.poster.avif?t=1778077979\" width=1170 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704270/extras/9791d511cff9ce13eb84b3072ab26ffd.webm?t=1778077979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704270/extras/9791d511cff9ce13eb84b3072ab26ffd.mp4?t=1778077979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Die at your Will</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is not merely an outcome, but a strategy. Use it to quickly return to your last save point, and retain all progress that you've accrued. Remain prudent in its use, as nothing in this world comes free.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 enemies, each with a unique soul ability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable HUD with attachable items for additional info.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A personal library filled with technical info, character details, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of areas within Castle Lexington to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time display of weapons &amp; souls in your inventory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional side quests with rewards for completion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller &amp; keyboard support with customizable controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable framerate from 60 to 240 FPS.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel-Perfect scaling with optional HD scaling.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704270/extras/99ed98be3a676baab592a9f217b7252d.poster.avif?t=1778077979\" width=1170 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704270/extras/99ed98be3a676baab592a9f217b7252d.webm?t=1778077979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704270/extras/99ed98be3a676baab592a9f217b7252d.mp4?t=1778077979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Eternal Soul is a gothic Metroidvania where you steal the souls of your enemies. Explore the ca